## 11. Decisiones de diseño

| Decisión | Elegida | Alternativa | Razón |
|----------|---------|-------------|-------|
| Charge model | Direct (la propia cuenta) | Connect | Standard no es marketplace |
| Checkout UX | Embedded (PaymentElement / PaymentSheet) | Hosted (redirect) | Mejor UX + más control + sin bypass del safety hook |
| Customer Portal | Built-in de Stripe | Custom UI | Stripe lo mantiene, gratis, cubre 90% de casos |
| Webhook endpoints | 1 | 2 (como Connect) | No hay event scope split en Standard |
| Idempotencia | tabla SQL `stripe_processed_events` | KV in-memory | Sobrevive reinicios de Edge Function |
| Subscriptions con 3DS | `payment_behavior='default_incomplete'` | Confirm manual con SetupIntent | Stripe official pattern, soporta SCA out of the box |
